Package: hyprland-protocols
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Wayland protocol extensions for the Hyprland compositor
 Hyprland protocols add functionality that is not available in
 wayland-protocols. This package ships the protocol XML files together with
 the pkg-config file used to locate them, and covers toplevel export for
 screen sharing, global shortcuts, focus grabbing, colour transform control,
 surface state, lock notification, toplevel mapping, workspace image capture
 sources and input capture.
